WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:11.240
mayakashi no izanai ni kotae tamae

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:11.240
Bewitched summoned being, entreat thou me thy reply.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.210
yobidashitaru sonata e to

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.210
Thou, who hast here summoned the likes of me,

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:32.840
michibikareshi mi wo

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:32.840
Bestow thou me guidance from thine own body.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:38.680
sashidasu wa senketsu no

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:38.680
Hark as this fresh blood from my fingertips flows,

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.850
yubisaki no akashi

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:43.850
As proof of our contract: Our destiny --

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:54.950
hikari no kami mo azamuku chikai

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:54.950
A vow to betray even the gods of Light.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:01:05.160
mayakashi no izanai ni kotae tamae

00:00:54.950 --> 00:01:05.160
Bewitched summoned being, entreat thou me thy reply.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:15.680
ochiru kogareru inochi wo toshite seiyaku no gi wo

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:15.680
As I plummet, I yearn for thee.
Swear to me thy very life.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:26.440
mune no kusabi ni tamuke no sanka shinen no chi e

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:26.440
Kiss the cleft of thy breast with my hesitant praise,
As we fall to earth to live the rest of our days.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:41.380
Aww, aren't there any good men around here I can get a drop of blood from?

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:45.120
They look so oily...

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:47.500
I might catch something from them...

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.080
Looks like I might have to go home without getting any...

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:54.500
Please help out and donate blood!

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.720
We're currently looking for type O and type A blood.

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:03.220
You'll be done in only 30 minutes, so please find the time to donate.

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:06.430
Iya~ Pachuru~

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:08.780
Please help out and do-

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:11.170
May I please have some of your blood?

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:13.000
I'm anemic...

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.000
I'd like your blood...

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:16.700
Your blood would be the best...

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:18.950
So... please become my slave.

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:23.980
Where should I suck him? Here? In the truck?

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:27.150
I'm all excited and ready to go... Just kiddin'!

00:02:27.810 --> 00:02:33.960
Ma'am, this is a place where receive blood from donors.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:38.220
Oh! Then, I'll just help out here!

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:42.670
Even if you said that so suddenly... I don't think it's possible.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.730
What? I can't?

00:02:44.730 --> 00:02:45.490
No, you can't.

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:47.480
It's almost time.

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:48.560
Okay!

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.930
W-wait!

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:53.270
Then, how am I supposed to receive some of your blood?

00:02:55.880 --> 00:03:01.880
Hm... if you were in a situation where you needed my blood to live, I would give a transfusion.

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:03.780
That's what blood donations are for, after all.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:05.940
Well, that's all for now.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:19.010
Pokaan ~ 5

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:19.010
Tomorrow's Spell is a Transfusion of Love

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:23.550
Please help out and donate blood!

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.010
Hello.

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:29.810
Oh, you're from yesterday... What is it today?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.730
U, um, I've come to make a donation today!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.350
Thank you for your generosity.

00:03:36.350 --> 00:03:38.120
Please, step right this way.

00:03:41.440 --> 00:03:44.400
Please help out and donate blood!

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:45.750
Today, we-

00:03:45.750 --> 00:03:46.160
Huh? What?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.810
Are you okay? You don't look too well, but-

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:53.880
A-Are you worrying over me?

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:58.180
Of course! If something were to happen to you...

00:03:58.830 --> 00:03:59.880
I'll come tomorrow!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:04.300
I'm happy to hear that, but...

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:08.200
You need to wait a while between donations.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:11.600
And anyway, are you sure your body is up to this?

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:17.390
Oh... I understand. I'll come again.

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.490
I'm so low on blood that I can't move...

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:27.240
Pachi-a-san! I'm bringing you some tomato juice!

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:35.740
Aiko!

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:37.340
Pachira-san...

00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:39.630
I'm sorry.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:40.490
Don't move.

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:51.630
Pachira-san... don't...

00:04:54.210 --> 00:04:56.050
Please help out!

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:59.440
Hello, I've come again.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:02.950
Oh, you. Are you feeling better today?

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:05.170
Yes! Of course!

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:07.110
Take as much as you want out of me!

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:10.450
Well then, step right in.

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:20.220
Today, we are especially low on type B.

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:25.560
T-the color of your face looks horrible! Are you okay?

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:30.340
As I thought, a delicate chest...

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:32.190
Excuse me?

00:05:32.190 --> 00:05:33.680
Nothing.

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:40.940
I want to suck it...

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.500
Don't try too hard.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.510
I'll come back.

00:05:53.190 --> 00:05:55.970
Pachira-san! I brought you some to-

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.840
Ah... Pachira-san, no...

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:04.880
Are those two okay?

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:28.650
Ai-chan, is dinner ready yet?

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:35.790
I... what am I...?

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:44.460
Pachira-san? Pachira-san? Pachira-san?

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:46.850
What's wrong, Ai-chan?

00:06:46.850 --> 00:06:51.440
She took all the tomato juice that I just bought into her room, and locked herself in!

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:53.390
What? What's with that?

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:56.200
Hogging the tomato juice, that's no fair!

00:06:56.200 --> 00:06:57.520
You drink it, Uma?

00:06:57.520 --> 00:06:59.200
I hate tomato juice!

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:02.750
Anyway, something about her seems strange.

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.860
The color of her face didn't look very good, either...

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:06.690
The color of her face?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.340
Just her face?

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:17.910
Dissing me behind my back... you better watch it!

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:21.820
Hey...

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:24.540
Some stranger came out. Creepy.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:26.640
It's me, can't you see?

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:30.640
You guys sure are in high spirits...

00:07:31.790 --> 00:07:33.340
Ya, sure are!

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:39.750
What's wrong? You in pain?

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:46.400
Hey, what the hell is this?

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:50.110
I'm begging you... don't show me your necks.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:52.130
Please.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:57.120
Pachira-san! Pachira-san!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.130
Please, open the door, Pachira-san!

00:07:59.130 --> 00:08:01.000
Pachira-san! Pachira-san!

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:07.000
I can sustain myself on love...

00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:10.760
If I can wait until tomorrow, I can see him again.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.820
Your blood! Let me suck your blood!

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:53.510
Wh-who did something like this?

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.380
Pachira-san, it was you.

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.930
Pachira-san, please stop.

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:02.020
I dont know what you're trying to do,

00:09:02.850 --> 00:09:06.520
But I can't stand seeing you in this condition.

00:09:06.870 --> 00:09:09.310
This is fresh blood.

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:12.750
Here, just drink this in one gulp.

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:17.300
Then, return to being the beautiful Pachira-san that we know.

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:19.780
Here.

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:31.000
Now, in one gulp!

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.910
Thank you, Aiko.

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:45.520
I was right about to give everything up.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.730
I'm fine now.

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:52.780
It might sound cliché, but my determination was hardened by seeing your tears.

00:09:54.270 --> 00:09:57.270
I think I'll be able to sleep soundly for the first time in a while tonight.

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:00.880
Then.... good night.

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.030
T-that's....

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:09.680
But I'm the one that has to clean up!

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.260
Please help out and donate blood!

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:25.310
Today, we are running low on all types of blood!

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:28.080
If you are somehow able to, please don-

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:32.440
I-I've come to donate.

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:37.190
Y-you! Look at what's happened to you!

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:38.610
How could you do something so reckless?

00:10:38.610 --> 00:10:40.890
In any case, we need to get some blood in you immediately.

00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.240
Your...

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:45.450
It's okay if it's your blood...

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:46.900
I understand.

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:51.530
I'm so happy... I can finally...

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:56.550
Excuse me, can you hurry and draw blood from me...

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:03.550
How are you? Do you know where you are?

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:06.370
I'm...

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:11.310
You're fine now. You just need to lie down for a little longer.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:22.870
I've become one... with you.

00:11:24.350 --> 00:11:26.520
You're a lifesaver!

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:29.000
I didn't think we'd be able to find the same blood type, but...

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:33.020
Don't be thanking me, it was all for saving another's life!

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:38.580
Your blood is flowing through my whole body~

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:43.160
I'm so happy right now!

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:07.160
Hm, well I guess we'll start with me.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:07.320
Pokan ~ 6

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:11.210
The Spell of Happiness is An Ideal Man!

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:15.610
I'd have to go with vegetarians.

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:18.170
Specifically guys that only eat freshly picked vegetables.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:25.640
Otherwise, I won't be able to dine on his silky, flowing blood.

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:31.640
Of course, he'd have to be a virgin, and know how to treat women right.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:36.650
And he'd be so high class that he'd have a butler!

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.940
And then... And then!

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:41.940
Go ahead.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:45.410
And someone that would pull back their long hair and let me bite their carotid artery!

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:50.410
Then, how about you, Liru?

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:54.150
Hm, yeah.

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:59.250
Well, if we're talking about boyfriends, I'd want someone wild and strong over some delicate guy.

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:03.260
Someone of the same species...

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:11.270
But someone with enough self control not to transform when he sees something round.

00:13:11.780 --> 00:13:13.770
Someone cool but kind...

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:17.770
With a boyish smile!

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:21.530
Someone that would prepare a lot of meat for would be the best!

00:13:28.550 --> 00:13:30.780
Okay, next, how about Ai-chan?

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:32.450
Oh, me?

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.040
Well...

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:38.410
I'm a little heavier than most girls, so...

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:40.310
A little?

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:45.880
I'm fairly heavy, so something that I'm really attracted to is...

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.550
Isn't this light?

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:55.770
Someone that could lift me up like it was nothing, and hold me like I was a princess!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:59.040
He'd also have to be exceptionally smart and wear glasses.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:05.440
Someone that's also delicate, and has a good job.

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:08.280
What kind of illusion is that?

00:14:10.960 --> 00:14:13.250
Well, you're next, Uma.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:16.540
Me... well what I want is...

00:14:16.860 --> 00:14:18.710
Well, I'm not looking for anything, really.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.910
Wha? So you're just going for looks?

00:14:21.910 --> 00:14:23.410
Not really.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.860
Don't they have to be well-off?

00:14:25.860 --> 00:14:27.550
Hm... not really.

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:34.560
Would you want some sort of powerful warlock?

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:35.430
No way.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:38.060
So you really aren't looking for anything?

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:39.510
Nope.

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:44.530
Someone that would just accept me for who I am, that's who I'm looking for!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.760
She might be reaching the most of all of us...

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:50.960
What? I just said I'm not looking for anything!

00:14:50.960 --> 00:14:53.490
I'm not-requiring any luxuries like you guys.

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:55.720
You're all aiming too high.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.430
You need to be more realistic.

00:14:57.430 --> 00:15:00.420
You really need to consider what guys might think of you.

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:03.490
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:07.300
Owie.... I'm seeing stars floating around my head...

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.830
Uma-san, I think you're aiming the highest.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:13.300
How can that be?

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:18.100
It suddenly got really humid in here...

00:15:18.360 --> 00:15:21.800
Well, someone must be letting the moisture from the rain get in here, making things get all moist...

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:24.610
Ahh! L-Liru-san!

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.940
Eh? I can't?

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.590
It's not like anyone else is around.

00:15:29.590 --> 00:15:30.980
That's true, but...

00:15:30.980 --> 00:15:32.450
It's so much cooler!

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:36.830
Really? Okay, then me too!

00:15:37.050 --> 00:15:38.970
Wow, you're right!

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:40.330
It's a little bit cooler!

00:15:40.770 --> 00:15:42.260
Uma-san, you too?

00:15:42.260 --> 00:15:44.680
But I'm drenched in sweat!

00:15:45.090 --> 00:15:47.340
I guess so...

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:50.510
You really do have some girlish proportions!

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:51.800
Hey, you-!

00:15:53.060 --> 00:15:55.300
I guess it is a bit cooler.

00:15:57.180 --> 00:16:02.190
Oh yeah, my glasses work as emergency lights!

00:16:10.060 --> 00:16:12.740
I put too much voltage into it...

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:16.200
You take your clothes off too, Ai.

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:20.950
No, I'm fine. I don't sweat, so...

00:16:21.270 --> 00:16:22.300
Take them off!

00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:22.670
Huh?

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:24.520
Alright! Let's get those clothes off!

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:27.500
Hey, wait! Quit it!

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:37.600
I can't become a bride anymore...

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.030
Now I'm hot again.

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:46.070
Oh yeah, going back to what we said earlier...

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:50.960
If you met your ideal man, how'd you want to meet him?

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:52.810
How'd we...

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:53.610
... meet?

00:16:54.300 --> 00:17:01.610
Well since he'd be high class, maybe at a ball!

00:17:01.630 --> 00:17:05.450
I'd pretend I was just a little bit frail...

00:17:05.450 --> 00:17:06.120
Isn't it beautiful?

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:09.830
And he'd whisper such sweet words into my ears!

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:13.630
Then, closing my eyes to reveal the shape of a crescent moon...

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:14.990
Kiss!

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:22.270
Oh please! I don't think they even hold balls anymore!

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.640
There's no way that could happen.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:27.760
Then, how about on a cruise?

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:30.650
How 'bout a night cruise on an elegant cruise ship?

00:17:32.180 --> 00:17:34.360
Just the ocean and the two of us...

00:17:34.990 --> 00:17:38.280
Your figure is even more beautiful than the stars.

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.660
Oh you....

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:42.800
And we'd lock eyes, and...

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:46.750
We'd share a kiss so beautiful even the fish would watch in admiration.

00:17:51.300 --> 00:17:53.600
You're really into cheesy lines like that!

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:56.010
Those silly clichés really turn you on, huh?

00:17:57.170 --> 00:17:59.890
Leave me alone, they're my dreams!

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:02.510
And anyway, what would someone like you want?

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:03.990
Me?

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:07.910
Hm... well...

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:11.320
I'd be the princess of some distinguished family, an-

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.590
Wait a second.

00:18:11.320 --> 00:18:12.590
Wait a second.

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:14.530
Huh? What is it?

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:16.530
That's impossible from the start.

00:18:19.350 --> 00:18:23.020
Then, I'd be a treasure hunter.

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:25.200
Oh, that really suits you!

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:27.700
Then, I'd be in a really bad situation.

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:31.390
Suddenly, that man appears out of nowhere!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:34.850
Then, he'd come and save me!

00:18:35.820 --> 00:18:36.720
Then, we kiss.

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:38.380
What the hell?

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:39.810
Hm?

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:42.990
Don't rush through the important parts!

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.390
Hm? Where?

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:49.390
"Where?" The part where you fall in love is completely missing!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:53.740
But, the man of my dreams would come and rescue me.

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:56.900
Then, I'd have to fall in love!

00:18:57.350 --> 00:19:02.970
You know, they say that love borne from strange situations never lasts.

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:05.410
Really? Then how about you, Aiko?

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:09.920
Well, I don't think Aiko's ideal man actually exists, but...

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:15.690
I'd be going out for groceries for dinner.

00:19:16.630 --> 00:19:20.220
Suddenly, one of my tires goes flat.

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:25.430
Then, he'd appear, and fix the bike!

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:29.250
Wait a second!

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:29.250
Wait a second!

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:34.550
Nothing's happened yet! He just fixed your flat!

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:37.240
He's saving me from a terrible situation.

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:39.990
You just said no love from strange situations!

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:41.770
